      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:31544:31546"
    },
    {
      "id": "132:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你怎么知道马克和茱莉的？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:31546:31562"
    },
    {
      "id": "132:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我见过他们。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:31562:31572"
    },
    {
      "id": "132:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“什么？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:31572:31579"
    },
    {
      "id": "132:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“有时候，我在这里见过他们。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:31579:31596"
    },
    {
      "id": "132:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你是他们的朋友吗？”你问道。他只是空洞地盯着你。“先生？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:31596:31628"
    },
    {
      "id": "132:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“他们在这里吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:31628:31639"
    },
    {
      "id": "132:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要让陌生人离开，转到 117。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:31639:31656"
    },
    {
      "id": "132:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要把门摔在他脸上，转到 128。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:31656:31674"
    }
  ]
}
